            "value" : "I skuggan av något större"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the shelter of a wall" : {
      "comment" : "One of forty figurative places a seed is imagined passing through on its way to the ground. Offered, already filled in, as the answer to 'Where' on the note about a meeting, and anybody can type over it. The register is the seed's journey rather than real geography, so it wants the same unhurried, slightly literary voice in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I ly af en mur"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al resguardo de un muro"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À l’abri d’un mur"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al riparo di un muro"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I ly av en mur"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In de beschutting van een muur"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I skydd av en mur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It leaves your garden for the Wild Fields. The person you grew it with keeps theirs, and every other plant here stays where it is." : {
      "comment" : "Said under the row while it is held, and in the alert on the assisted path. Worded for what survives rather than for what goes, like the three in Settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Den forlader din have og tager ud på Vildmarken. Den, du groede den sammen med, beholder sin, og alle andre planter bliver her, hvor de er."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Se va de tu jardín a los Campos Silvestres. La persona con la que la cultivaste conserva la suya, y las demás plantas de aquí se quedan donde están."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Elle quitte ton jardin pour les Champs Sauvages. La personne avec qui elle a poussé garde la sienne, et toutes les autres plantes ici restent où elles sont."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lascia il tuo giardino per i Campi Selvatici. La persona con cui è cresciuta conserva la sua, e ogni altra pianta qui resta dov'è."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Den forlater hagen din og drar ut på Villmarka. Den du dyrket den fram sammen med, beholder sin, og alle andre planter blir her, der de er."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Hij verlaat je tuin voor de Wilde Velden. De plant van de persoon met wie je hem hebt laten groeien blijft, en elke andere plant hier blijft waar hij is."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Den lämnar din trädgård och ger sig ut på Vildmarken. Den du odlade den tillsammans med behåller sin, och alla andra växter blir kvar här, där de är."
          }
        }
      }
    },
