    "Somewhere over the water" : {
      "comment" : "One of forty figurative places a seed is imagined passing through on its way to the ground. Offered, already filled in, as the answer to 'Where' on the note about a meeting, and anybody can type over it. The register is the seed's journey rather than real geography, so it wants the same unhurried, slightly literary voice in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et sted over vandet"
          }
