    "The imprints swirling together:" : {
      "comment" : "First of four lines that arrive one at a time under that heading, at the pace they can be read. The four are one sentence: this line opens a list and the next three are its items.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aftrykkene, der hvirvler sammen:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
