            "value" : "Ditt namn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name sits beside your plant on the other person's phone, and in the note they keep of the meeting." : {
      "comment" : "Under the field where somebody types the name the other person will see. Asked once, on the way into a first meeting.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit navn står ved siden af din plante på den andens telefon og i den note, de gemmer om mødet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu nombre aparece junto a tu planta en el teléfono de la otra persona, y en la nota que guarda del encuentro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ton nom apparaît à côté de ta plante sur le téléphone de l’autre personne, et dans la note qu’elle garde de la rencontre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo nome compare accanto alla tua pianta sul telefono dell’altra persona, e nella nota che conserva dell’incontro."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Navnet ditt står ved siden av planten din på telefonen til den andre, og i notatet de tar vare på om møtet."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jouw naam staat naast je plant op de telefoon van de ander, en in het briefje dat zij van de ontmoeting bewaren."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ditt namn står bredvid din växt på den andras telefon, och i anteckningen de sparar om mötet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own seed and its plant stay. The people you grew those plants with keep theirs." : {
      "comment" : "Appears under 'Empty the garden' while it is being held down.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit eget frø og dets plante bliver. De mennesker, du groede de planter sammen med, beholder deres."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu propia semilla y su planta se quedan. Las personas con las que cultivaste esas plantas conservan las suyas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta propre graine et sa plante restent. Les personnes avec qui tu as fait pousser ces plantes gardent les leurs."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo seme e la sua pianta restano. Le persone con cui hai fatto crescere quelle piante conservano le loro."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ditt eget frø og planten fra det blir. Menneskene du dyrket fram de plantene sammen med, beholder sine."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je eigen zaadje en de plant daarvan blijven. De mensen met wie je die planten hebt laten groeien, houden de hunne."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ditt eget frö och dess växt stannar. De du odlade de växterna tillsammans med behåller sina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your plant and %@, together" : {
      "comment" : "Under a newly made plant's name, from the second meeting onward. %@ is the other person's plant's name — a Latin binomial, never translated.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din plante og %@, sammen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu planta y %@, juntas"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta plante et %@, ensemble"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La tua pianta e %@, insieme"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Planten din og %@, sammen"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jouw plant en %@, samen"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din växt och %@, tillsammans"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your plant can meet others if you tap their device. A brand new and unique seed will be formed every time." : {
      "comment" : "A panel over the main screen, shown until the first meeting has happened. 'Tap' is one phone knocked lightly against another.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din plante kan møde andre, når du banker mod deres enhed. Hver gang bliver der dannet et helt nyt og enestående frø."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu planta puede encontrarse con otras si tocas su dispositivo. Cada vez se forma una semilla nueva y única."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta plante peut en rencontrer d’autres si tu touches leur appareil. Une graine toute neuve et unique se forme à chaque fois."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La tua pianta può incontrarne altre se tocchi il loro dispositivo. Ogni volta si forma un seme nuovo e unico."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Planten din kan møte andre når du dunker mot enheten deres. Hver gang blir det dannet et helt nytt og unikt frø."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jouw plant kan andere planten ontmoeten als je hun toestel aantikt. Elke keer ontstaat er een gloednieuw, uniek zaadje."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Din växt kan möta andra om du knackar mot deras enhet. Varje gång bildas ett alldeles nytt och unikt frö."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your plants have created a brand new seed." : {
      "comment" : "Shown over a plant made at somebody's first meeting. 'Your plants' is the two of them, one from each phone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeres planter har skabt et helt nyt frø."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las dos plantas han creado una semilla nueva."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos plantes ont créé une graine toute neuve."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le vostre piante hanno creato un seme nuovo."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plantene deres har skapt et helt nytt frø."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jullie planten hebben een gloednieuw zaadje gemaakt."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Era växter har skapat ett alldeles nytt frö."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your seed and %@’s." : {
      "comment" : "Under 'Crossing'. %@ is the other person's name; the sentence means their seed and yours. Note the possessive.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit frø og %@’s."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu semilla y la de %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta graine et celle de %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo seme e quello di %@."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frøet ditt og %@ sitt."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jouw zaadje en dat van %@."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ditt frö och %@:s."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your seed, your plant and your garden all go. The people you have met keep the plants you grew together." : {
      "comment" : "Appears under 'Reset everything' while it is being held down.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit frø, din plante og din have forsvinder alle sammen. De mennesker, du har mødt, beholder de planter, I groede frem sammen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu semilla, tu planta y tu jardín se van. Las personas que has conocido conservan las plantas nacidas de esos encuentros."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta graine, ta plante et ton jardin s’en vont tous. Les personnes que tu as rencontrées gardent les plantes que vous avez fait pousser ensemble."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo seme, la tua pianta e il tuo giardino se ne vanno tutti. Le persone che hai incontrato conservano le piante che avete fatto crescere insieme."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frøet ditt, planten din og hagen din forsvinner alle sammen. Menneskene du har møtt, beholder plantene dere dyrket fram sammen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je zaadje, je plant en je tuin gaan allemaal weg. De mensen die je hebt ontmoet, houden de planten die jullie samen hebben laten groeien."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ditt frö, din växt och din trädgård försvinner allihop. De du har mött behåller växterna ni odlade tillsammans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your username will only show publicly if you approve." : {
      "comment" : "Under that switch.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit brugernavn vises kun offentligt, hvis du godkender det."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu nombre de usuario solo aparece públicamente si tú lo apruebas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ton nom d’utilisateur n’apparaît publiquement que si tu l’acceptes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo nome utente compare pubblicamente solo se lo approvi."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brukernavnet ditt vises bare offentlig hvis du godkjenner det."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je gebruikersnaam komt alleen publiek in beeld als jij dat goedkeurt."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ditt användarnamn visas offentligt bara om du godkänner det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "and mutations of the random." : {
      "comment" : "Last of the four first-screen lines, and the end of the sentence.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "og mutationer af det tilfældige."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "y mutaciones del azar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "et des mutations du hasard."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "e mutazioni del caso."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "og mutasjoner av det tilfeldige."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "en mutaties van het toeval."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "och mutationer av slumpen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in this specific digital space," : {
      "comment" : "Third of the four first-screen lines.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "i netop dette digitale rum,"
